---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';import {modules} from '../../data/modules';
---
<Layout title="All Features | SEMS-ERP School Management" description="Explore SEMS-ERP features in detail: admissions, students, timetables, attendance, fees, exams, homework, portals, communication, reporting and administration.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">The complete feature overview</span><h1 class="h1">The tools your school needs. <span class="text-indigo">One connected platform.</span></h1><p class="lead">Explore the modules behind everyday school operations. Each page explains practical workflows verified from the SEMS-ERP application source.</p><div class="anchor-links">{modules.map(m=><a href={`#${m.slug}`}>{m.title}</a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="editorial-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">More than a list of modules</span><h2 class="h2">Follow the information through your school.</h2></div><div><p>From the first admission application to the term's report card, SEMS-ERP provides connected workspaces for records that school teams use every day.</p><p>Explore each module for specific functions, typical workflows and scope clarifications. The platform is designed for school administrators, teachers, accountants, students and parents, subject to their assigned access.</p></div></div><div class="grid2">{modules.map(m=><article class="feature-card" id={m.slug}><div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{m.icon}</div><span class="eyebrow">{m.number} · {m.eyebrow}</span><h2 style="font-size:1.55rem;margin:14px 0">{m.title}</h2><p>{m.intro}</p><ul class="check-list" style="margin:18px 0 22px">{m.features.slice(0,3).map(f=><li>{f.title}</li>)}</ul><a href={`/features/${m.slug}/`}>View detailed features and workflow →</a></article>)}</div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">A connected school lifecycle</span><h2 class="h2">One record can support many decisions.</h2><p class="lead">Follow a typical student journey across the modules.</p></div><div class="process-rail">{[{n:'01',t:'Admit',d:'Review an application and enrol an approved student.'},{n:'02',t:'Organise',d:'Assign classes, sections and academic schedules.'},{n:'03',t:'Operate',d:'Record attendance, coursework and fee transactions.'},{n:'04',t:'Review',d:'Enter results, print report cards and examine reports.'}].map(x=><article class="process-card"><span class="process-index">{x.n}</span><h3>{x.t}</h3><p>{x.d}</p></article>)}</div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">DETAILED MODULE GUIDES</span><h2 class="h2">Know what each module does <span class="text-teal">before you request a demo.</span></h2><p class="lead">Each feature guide explains the workflow, individual capabilities, data entered, saved records, available outputs and important limitations. This makes it easier to evaluate SEMS-ERP against your school’s real requirements.</p></div><div class="grid3"><article class="detail"><span class="eyebrow">01 / EXPLORE</span><h3>Read the workflow</h3><p>Follow the tasks staff complete from first action through review and reporting.</p></article><article class="detail"><span class="eyebrow">02 / UNDERSTAND</span><h3>See records and outputs</h3><p>Identify what information is captured and which views or documents are available.</p></article><article class="detail"><span class="eyebrow">03 / VERIFY</span><h3>Check actual scope</h3><p>Understand supported actions and where integrations or automation have not been verified.</p></article></div></div></section><CTA/>
</Layout>
